# Venerated Loxodon ({4}{W}) is cast with Bot1's Ornithopters A and B tapped for convoke (CR 702.51a) and three Moxen
# paying the rest. Ornithopter C (Bot1's, did not convoke) and Bot2's Ornithopter did not convoke, so they get nothing
# ("each creature that convoked it"). With the enters trigger on the stack Lightning Bolt kills convoker B: it
# convoked, but it is no longer the same object on the battlefield (CR 400.7), so only Ornithopter A gets its one
# counter (+1/+1, power 1 and toughness 3 from 0/2) and the Loxodon itself, which did not convoke, stays 4/4.

